              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "text-editor",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p style=\"font-size:15px;color:#6B6355;line-height:1.85;margin-bottom:17px;\">You moved to Singapore, London, or New Jersey for a better future. Your parents stayed back in Kolkata. And every time the phone rings late at night, your heart skips a beat.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;color:#6B6355;line-height:1.85;margin-bottom:17px;\">We saw our own parents wait 3 hours at clinics for a 5-minute BP check. Monsoon meant skipped medicines. A 3 AM fall meant helpless calls from halfway around the world. <em style=\"color:#7A5C3A;\">That fear drove us to act.</em></p><p style=\"font-size:15px;color:#6B6355;line-height:1.85;\">Today, we are a team of <strong style=\"color:#1C1A16;\">CMIG Kolkata certified gerontologists</strong> and MCI-registered doctors offering both telemedicine consultations and in-home elder care — built specifically for <strong style=\"color:#1C1A16;\">West Bengal seniors</strong> and the families who love them from afar.</p>",
                "typography_typography": "custom",
                "typography_font_family": "Jost",
                "margin": {
                  "unit": "px",
                  "top": "0",
                  "right": "0",
